    "Transition seamlessly by warping two images from one image to the next in a fresh and fluid way.",
    "Ready to beam up some easy but impressive presets for slides, swirls, and other creative transitions? Engage! Simply keyframe the Mix duration (see below)&#160;and tune to taste. Find these presets via the blue Open Dashboard... button or the Choose a Preset... button below it.",
    "As with all other Universe tools, you can modify or create a Warp&#160;Transition look and then save it under its own name by pressing the Save Preset... button."
